==Description==
Atlas lifters are equippable tools a player can place on ship parts that are detached from a ship. Once attached, the object they are attached to starts to float. It can then be pushed/pulled with a grappling hook. They are mainly used to drag ship parts that are outside the bubble into the bubble where they can be manipulated with the [[Gauntlet#Lift Mode|ship building tool]].

===Schematic===
The schematic for Atlas Lifters can be found in [[Biome#Remnants (Tier 3)|Tier 3]] and up.

